# S3 layout (per 1° tile)

```text
N59/E018/
  geonames.geojson              ← optional raw dump from GeoNames build
  v1/tiles/highres.json.gz      ← GeoNames cities + future OSM place points
  v1/tiles/lowres.json.gz       ← simplified place labels
  v1/tiles/marinas.json.gz      ← mooring points (implemented)
  v1/tiles/harbours.json.gz     ← planned
  v1/tiles/anchorages.json.gz   ← planned
  v1/tiles/seamarks.json.gz     ← planned (buoys, beacons, notices, …)
  v1/tiles/lights.json.gz       ← planned (optional split from seamarks)
```

Prefix format: `N{lat}/E{lon}` or `S…/W…` — see `DegreeTile` in `src/server/geo-features/tile.ts`.

